4. STANDARD CONSTANTS
The following are declared by A3 and used by the Verifiable Agency Theorem: Constant Meaning Typical value
K Max plan length (steps) 64
D_cond Max conditional nesting depth 4
D_invoke Max PlanStep invocation depth 3
m Max plan library size 4096
budget_max Max task-level cycle budget 10⁶
These are standard constants — deployments may tighten them, not loosen them.
Loosening violates the Verifiable Agency Theorem's assumptions.
