8. PLAN AND THE THREE FIXES
Fix How A3 Contributes
Fix 1 (Architecture) A3 fixes the shape of plans. Every conforming implementation has the
same plan schema, same composition rules, same DECOMPOSE semantics.
Fix 2 (Behavior) A3 leaves the content of P to deployment. Automotive plans ≠ grid plans.
Same grammar, different libraries.
Fix 3 (Safety) A3 delivers the bounded-length property. Without it, DECOMPOSE could
produce unbounded sub-task sequences, violating the Verifiable Agency Theorem. 9. WHAT A3 DOES NOT SPECIFY
